sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Browser
    participant A as API
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant M as Email

    U->>A: POST /api/auth/register (username, email, password)
    A->>A: check the body with Zod, check password strength
    A->>DB: is the email or username already taken?
    A->>A: hash the password with bcrypt
    A->>DB: create user (emailVerified = false)
    A->>DB: create authToken (EMAIL_VERIFY, only the hash)
    A->>M: send the link .../verify?token=RAW
    A-->>U: 201 "check your email"
    U->>A: GET /api/auth/verify?token=RAW
    A->>DB: find by SHA-256(RAW), not used, not expired
    A->>DB: emailVerified = true, mark the token used
    A-->>U: redirect to the login page
